                <head>Supplementary extradition treaty between the United States and Norway, signed
                    February 1, 1938</head>
                <p>[For text of treaty, see Department of State Treaty Series No. 934, or 53 Stat.
                    1561. See also telegram No. 96, March 10, 1934, 1 p.m., to the Ambassador in
                    France, <ref target="frus:frus1934v01/pg_794"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1934, volume I, page 794</ref>, for the instruction
                    initiating the negotiations of a number of such treaties with European
                    countries.]</p>
